From e880d3ae843ef8e41cfedb10c6a81fd1c801e471 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun Kumar Reddy Yaparla <vyaparla@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 23 Dec 2021 12:41:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-67662] gaudi2: add key validation support

This patch adds key validation support by implementing
the necessary functions in preboot to validate boot fit itb

Change-Id: I8278b10757ea619255b1a21e07daabaa11e4d1a5
---

